howtoplay.utilitycraft.machines.h6=Triturador
howtoplay.utilitycraft.machines.h7=Digitalizador
howtoplay.utilitycraft.machines.h8=EletroPress
howtoplay.utilitycraft.machines.h9=Colheitadeira
howtoplay.utilitycraft.machines.h10=Incinerador
